    "Education: Seminars: Modern Talking",
    "Modern Talking",
    "During the two-week course, second year students learned the basics of",
    "programming using the text editor Atom, implementing HTML as well as JS and",
    "CSS. During a five-day field trip to transmediale at the Haus der Kulturen der Welt,",
    "students populated an Instagram account whose content was fed into a dynamic",
    "poster generator developed with Atom. The course concluded with a workshop",
    "supervised by students from",
